{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyyqMRVGZaWtiwEJpqr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fitted the three spin-allowed bands first to get Dq and B, then used the doublet band to set C.\n\n**1. Spin-allowed bands give Dq and B.** High-spin Co²⁺ (d⁷) has a ⁴T₁g(F) ground state. These three bands depend only on Dq and B, not on C:\n\n- ⁴T₁ → ⁴T₂: 7 150 cm⁻¹\n- ⁴T₁ → ⁴A₂: 15 200 cm⁻¹\n- ⁴T₁ → ⁴T₁(P): 19 200 cm⁻¹\n\nA quick check: the gap between the ⁴A₂ and ⁴T₂ bands, 15 200 − 7 150 = 8 050 cm⁻¹, equals 10Dq, so Dq is about 805 cm⁻¹. But solving the strong-field formulas exactly with that value does not reproduce all three bands at once (the ⁴T₁(P) band comes out at about 18 900 instead of 19 200 cm⁻¹). So I used a least-squares fit of all three bands to the full d⁷ energy matrices:\n\n- **Dq = 815 cm⁻¹** (10Dq ≈ 8 150 cm⁻¹)\n- **B = 878 cm⁻¹**\n- The fit reproduces the bands as 7 086, 15 231 and 19 199 cm⁻¹. The root-mean-square error is 41 cm⁻¹.\n\n**2. The spin-forbidden band gives C.** The ²T₁(2) level depends on C, so I held Dq and B fixed and varied C until it matched 21 130 cm⁻¹:\n\n- At C = 4 499 cm⁻¹, ²T₁(2) falls at 22 690 cm⁻¹.\n- At C = 4 000 cm⁻¹, ²T₁(2) falls at 21 193 cm⁻¹.\n- That is a slope of about 3.0 cm⁻¹ per cm⁻¹ of C. Interpolating linearly to 21 130 cm⁻¹ gives **C ≈ 3 980 cm⁻¹**. I did not recompute the levels at exactly that C.\n- This gives C/B ≈ 4.5. Compared with free Co²⁺, B is reduced to about 78% (B₀ ≈ 1 120 cm⁻¹), which fits a fairly ionic fluoride lattice.\n\n**Result:** Dq ≈ 815 cm⁻¹, B ≈ 878 cm⁻¹, C ≈ 3 980 cm⁻¹.\n\n{\"Dq\": 815, \"B\": 878, \"C\": 3980, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Quartet bands fit Dq and B; the 2T1(2) band at 21130 cm-1 fixes C.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2220,"cache_read_input_tokens":10058,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2220,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35a463c8-3f3e-473c-9396-0e6169f74b2b","uuid":"8e4531fa-e580-428e-bc13-349fefb80217","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:41:01.366Z","request_id":"req_011CghyyptPkcFCgnujDAxHE"}
